{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fa9c5ff4a48d69336cbd3669fa1e20404ed8b71367c2987748af0f09cd2b38881087b9e89d0676f74d37c82355d4e93784a285487c665857b39aa4fa653294eb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/93f153464badc467011b98243fd0b6df913ebdd076d78d233f335e965af2e16f505c31e748c532ba0898086ae090fc73df68a02d527d25f0544e53cb19521efafb34e661c89a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/46b32e76be2a36ac92c849a36dacf8aaa7bc4cbf6e48d580c26a480f280b84a125378721e919310cfbca54f4d3f060ef63c3607b1975d5c2eb0efdef6f40e091a97d0310ab0a07c5161f438b3cd66d2cb2df44565b7772257150265911ceaef51981e8e85c6dadecf93239c75d7421c5e0d68587209f6582\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8353eac0c27bd206d47094b15036ca73c8f66b1e024f54729562234d73cf83186b0cdfe76b2a171203c87177d80da650084900dc83306a665b654895d1b80380d0b0d8ff33b334fdd34dc51f6f56a55e07b158088b21606a9d85bab48a171133061ba1efb8768cdd360fa2acc96102b9139d7e42ca711bd9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/64399b74ff7d7a83b630ac4c3cce8378e15efa470726cd46499735178ac4734fd7a8ace25d94965e029275e619ce249784bc15be8509d02edac18a931b84af13816c164140499193fce2af4d9915c2728984415d5c975acaadf859b56784a10085f67ab28b650d2a9ff930a1905a1c4292c3153db75d75bb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a99bb538a95153b0ee52f66411d4aa3d2a4614e6686136612c0437b56baae65a19082b65ff4f884badb33ef0c0895772f03dd868b22b418d3bc96a095ef43473756df7ff66cd6717732fda5e37359273361e3db0a144020aa31a9f377783ed902c0891ff1919b1cbd70bbb78dc2166170d4f0b444e75c59c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c19a89249a23957503147aeaed832bc67ddfd5c8accf8830529961a4befe39e5584f6d83d3253d6d2cf472ef668025aeb237fb92beff17220da785a09a28c516863f4453b56190283384e62540516ae2fc088f9e15d152cbedaa8954fb9e0525158ceb17f8a7569ca9b6ccaf617b24d9187687cff5214502\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d5f00e7710d3991ae381ec1070432f565fbfc46e09a807b57df98ad061f9287af386651fe5663b6ada53584a4e2e0656030c8e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5558644e61f290ce0f54475cf480924d98f02893cf9464b07b4f35a89d42ca349755cb92f8a1ed4399b92e67adc06953bba615f24fec520643118e16d8fdcc1da1a03ef02bfcbadcfefc655a385a523c1129b1f926e76422b07ba136436afd958e06d52b00d6071f2bcfda5c9838b55e2f6e9d113179c8aa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3dd01f8e556dede9942a98c961fb1d46bda886092a7f7405b40bb744ae4f66a09ae88bf4802b985b6a56e80ec5f10a445197baafc3b1eb9365ba314f1d27c4f7fb9aa183f03109fccd26b4d4a92f68a69c5f7dbebdc8dc2b5adf6770e9343011047eea87b718aa6430887b13bd8e32417d49fd72a8071028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8d2f85b0330f86a0b42bf168b01da8686f04f6140da0d15f6ead28eab9025a576692dc2f6a478019f2c9fa39675dee2a86041f1ff2b159d2f91a250b8c522accd97bc73d1cfbb7b36d38d32a0fffce3249cc0b5a7957d624a2526529fcfc5ba96d2c6b75147525518a9784c23f8de3fa03f9f19c36db42be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/648c5676d99ba17c5875c5101d3071a161e0bf6a48ed5a3695403d0e8dabe36134ace2696c92f67605a882635ca86764c9333a231a4c365a414be920bcd28e4889a7db845bf804e556bcdd9754c2d51f64263390670576bdc02cd342f3c6a88c1f070316175dfb261e78d571282c60bd8085f04564ad1513\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9f73c883451adb940fd9e472bd17b6b7886c3ccdb4673a2b9ebe6a81a5d9442519473f8d1e5fd2072df69ffa17fe81f7ed0ab773a20f3d51264532c4ae6b15b88f3467d964654afa572e0a25a34ccf851dfcd5c91af50359c2be25527334263509e1680a87415276383903ec754c36364a94bde842cdb3b8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/362b34118bad68c8c2a7b571e55ff66af9d9141b9c2e454768f3a9211169c7152bf6ce5897edcaf03891792fea3ddb567d2688c550b04c0f1f23a6e5de240c736ca4a5fc7cadb1e2d8605e8c26011c5dc670601ee5e71da7401e1c4a24f895ff51b48647d9adf980814fa5484b2d419d348301899dee08fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2cbef4b82146e5360252f468a74f6f676027ff0fe42090024cc62fef0df19f67930423bec859f406e8d6361879add26a8da13821efe9aed879a066c09357864fc90dfa45328e619f53be1735888db6f7262dfe5c7e428a0096a79c6aae1334d9d9ee78c658511b28637c2baf4a593d5314d195e4d2626107\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e918f7e5a7c5371ad60ade1c918de21c8e4997c1a38e90144e3ecd37783c0d020a1e5412bfa8ec815a69937dfeeeac01797c0d7defc71897af2aac11c4326d7ad186533dde1df64152383457d7daf91840db29ad1cff0ce472a777536103f78abdd7438fe0c953c90056be7c3ecb8f7f6286c30ad1425393\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a894268150349737ebaa06beff7d3753be2617d57b3f41879c1ec7dc930a339a333be540fbdc42c9124c0a358233843e6de374ef6d6bf74fa0121c71b418b26c9ad02f2d60e958f9b30932d36e2308afb4b574ef7746998e0adb1a9f85ebdb01926c7ea99b1471cc1198251340ec19b5f1052b941d770d0b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cec08419297d368ad57a34a341617e4555b5ba5c0da87081ddf5e32014a3bed6e3ec1bd9115a824895ceb46e80f2a3eaa199822a2cb16f51b5228a4a8e962219734193c127b50b981b4837421b80cf367eb57e3f8f545dcdb698e8ba1ba5a8f4a1b0228f6e30135df204d4331b52757a3160a876fe4acca5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/efa49fa00bedbf29c9da2791a7960feb742bec7bc6c6613f9e5accabc1ffcea165024b35ba5a3bc2a11daca439eb402950323e1bc25cab1099e573b60f51bf5e464c524163dd297b26820ebc4119daac1be2d62514c24a75b898199b0b1a5e45209ca5f611e6a67288d626587ff934d6513c6983da62c620\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f3c61bc6e8eb06b9ac98383929b1e14fa461ad9eb2706ef5419b598d869b7fb4a4cf085bb69be4cd5c2817af7b5fd391364c1f6c7dbed753ed951c0345ab534d8a88b6a7a49eb527410cef972cd8c07f75a1157e18158f8ba54135f09f257e99eaed85fa13c1e3324cd7b946d89a254cacdb9449ac04baeb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/019ed45ca078e511443ea4e274578891e1c47375692104fc280b23cb97b7aae3d049bbcacd5b21b890ae4b48fa779bf325ed08ccedeb905b5889c554b97896bd72346abd9ba4d17a60c6b9f4b8f121013c321568e86fc54ababa64d762fa1698c3c128db1ce58326cfe5ab0d9c3aa435e2ee6ef67a653aed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/327ce8bbbd44366de5ff69e8faf28e615c951f4ec9f9fe4296d2be81aa491f03cea39a7c4ce2c6af00ec7d28a092e45cae30db8b0829000e8129a65428bb0a85da38bf715a25e607d7fdea62be89c550a9f334bfb75192180e4390852724c97f0d489efeca4c18102f5ca0107fdb9cc12c638cb5b8a02066\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7ad557e3b095f431fd4a92b998330848f178171f046d69b7a1f8fe59517b3297771caa2827a89335641c98e6638eca244d1cb781d41244b8fd942b163bac65f1d9e571de54f90cc785aa29359579254cd24f7c5907faf6644798936d2e895e133027133df701ad97df2d3ad5dfd0fd1fbcf374776bb37313\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b4db9630b11f1495173c3edf159c8aa1c50de65ec87f2cc3c5fe07e8b9faa9586485a7ecbc8db37cb50dfb882512a1fe54b2f1ad86329cecf551f0637b8a2f43a02c0ce5726958802e24736947f9d50958732ce80613fdb52453082e7422b9cc29cde0d25938f89db55dbf6ebc883dfffea4face8dbfac02\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e55203b743dd48e0aac8075ba88f757bc0ae08fb701f0fa5fe7330a8cb3073484cb0457f31c6cbebac93d4dba2d09946a16c9a2d371dc4a3bb09f128951dd7ac86cea6b6df0e1bf4264c8918f76af2c1749a86c8f2263af0371f473a372015cc2d218a2feb0c84f177742848a43d643253685f8d3ba2803e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/202e72541ce2cba4032d7563b9e359c53233c268ac4095f287c7029d764babdb4a009e8188af0f31f3fa5010f59579d0f79f4c7bc1e8cf933bde367ff6be351329152bd2c01126a599f10c4e3dadceb5a3b727c9adfe6e4e2d4f939009206ebc50009cc3403cf981c2e8cf744acf8de40b823fb688cd8be0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c6dd41de9a42663643cd349d3dae9dfc60ed93123007579a4fe14792063ee1093200487ba09e6a60623b082f3cee2fefe401781f26e1e77b2a96b138f87ab7230a62311cb443ce9277045b841c00cbafd659e8948bd655cf8fda30259fa64f780bd5bf515239e05e1e5625468945fa19ba0f201891b16e8f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/29301e36a160715ded41c31fc9d8695d26ac9980ca7177b39504730c55d5e721d67aa7cb0d98f4f23f6c0e60455f6e08a3783c1b37e47686b6daf321152a54f1d1ce1b6568ef0feb4e832f820ffa5ae35e3b910204707c8a290770\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/07df5f1a0d47bb08fc4628ac3a20d5e7e6ea69f5a3aa9273b0eae7706ab4c74121da814246b04b3f76e900f77b3a5fbc5e25bc2837d161e0bd0f058ac54107f6aab80e58f994ece55b008236022504e22c86d015871fc69845f77a0745b3c7c350fc5deccccac041bad14293cea1b23d29937c267b672af3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f9c28db4d32eb38a6780f62d738fa61170646e6ccf93952eaba325b47b7d555891fab793263357753bd3004ab549f8ffaf8847c96b1ffd40b256455ebb485e39c4f07bfa312c8dc669306c92f11ec93d425a3bfa1f0edd626b43616b3ddbad3a10322ede6be2b319b28d4edcd46e61f5db535696c4e574e0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b5414055d72d470f7b30a827868ce56a902dab2088d20153c5e10f9ae3f5fb1e742a21478b31236224b0108c6ec9c39fd5edf90f6bf5747ddc8d31d2dbfdacc29851d080467cade57a5c1523edc5692100407734d01a4353e7f028a719eda802360189cd7f85c66a8ba92f414beb4331da6db3b5d9a70f83\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a7f6510cb013a1829c8d72e21cffee886eee33529a58fc337a56cbfb8f970a6d1380531461a3775b66fe78836dd34bf803a2c85c9f6a576a1104d1bc01137281aa649cb62dcbbe678c7ba652376530139f1077fa3f272587d15b45b539133d572492d1f6c96a2d7eb8f453aba29575f1c46038a71c4507f2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c80775281195b460219c0a2d820e0f946773539629631cd6a3d9bf998238c0613ab6e038fa725072b9b1ee5b0270f47dea80e1777eeccb699cd78ce9681200d2e5b7c56b625c81db2c745ccad85637077ef6ab6520215393caff3a7e9b0f7b4441cb43c56891ab46d615e11dc729e6c364a91cf299c2a6d5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/298d70243972eb6358fa66faf5ec497b31b578377e1bd789c67033eaa7296f27c80d232a5a772edfbbf7541fa8e22ac067afcff65dc63f895464a55efad47ea0bd6ff12b894b959647b851d1706f5888d66a7c1023a66fca6c69efc921a38904cb8cc883e8986e6c0b4350dc7e3108aba19d308877dafbe3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/408652bb81d0af719e21b860d50321ce56dcede2e3a956b2246f348a7a365ea3293ad51bbd919702eaa7dfd78b3e2c24ced7080a8b234ee20a8c57731b12c9eb83fe731e21aa00ba8b2d2d4b007ef0c86c69705c1806fe545c28247a93b2c539b08810e5aea475038798c8ffc233683f89b21aa6770201c4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
